 "titulo": "3.6.0 Patch Notes (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1511852597357,
 "modificada": 1732667607406,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2213/978663",
 "html": "<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.<br /> <br />Marvel Future Fight 3.6 is here! We&rsquo;re bringing you 5 new characters, 2 new uniforms, and improvements with the visuals and some of the game&rsquo;s mechanics.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff3300; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">▣</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff3300;\"> 5 New Characters</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff3300;\"><br /> </span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br />Nova (Sam Alexander), Blue Marvel, America Chavez, Anti-man and Quasar have been added to future fight.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281518/Novaa.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281519/BlueMarvell.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281520/AmericaChavezz.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281520/AntiMann.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281521/Quasarr.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #0070c0;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; color: #0070c0;\">Blue Marvel is awarded at 6</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol'; color: #0070c0;\">★</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; color: #0070c0;\"> for completing the Story Mission chapter 13-8<br />-Blue Marvel&rsquo;s biometric data can be obtained from the Ultimate Hero Chest, available in the store.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #0070c0; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\">Anti-man and Nova can be obtained from the Ultimate Hero Chest in the store.<br /> <img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281522/UltimateHeroChest.png\" /><br /> </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕';\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">Blue Marvel, Anti-Man and Nova (Sam Alexander) are not available for &#115;election via biometrics &#115;electors or 20 Biometrics Daily. <br /> </span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕';\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">America Chavez can be acquired from story missions in chapter 13<br /> </span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕';\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">Quasar is available from the &lsquo;Get 20 Biometrics Daily&rsquo; package.<br /></span></span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">※The Ultimate Hero Chest also contains other characters except those that can be obtained from the 20 Biometrics Daily Packs and&nbsp;X-Men characters. (Added)<br /> <br /> </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff3300; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">▣</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff3300;\"> 2 New Uniforms<br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br />Uniforms for Phil Coulson and Inferno have been added.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281523/07.png\" /></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕';\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">These uniforms will be available for 750 Crystals for a limited time, after which they will return to their normal price of 1250 Crystals. <br /> <br /> </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff3300; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">▣</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff3300;\"> New Story Mission Chapters and Other Mission Changes</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff3300;\"><br /> </span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br />1. A new story chapter has been added. Take the fight to SHIELD HQ, the Triskelion and the Alpha Flight Station in these all-new stages.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281524/StoryMissionUpdate.png\" /></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">2. We are also making a few tweaks to chapters 1~3. The levels and grades of some of the villain characters have been upgraded, some bosses will change their skills.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281524/MoreStoryMissionUpdate.png\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">3. Stage Mission images have been changed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281600/Resized_10.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff3300; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">▣</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #ff3300; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"> Story Mission Character Growth difficulty change</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br />Heroes that are available on stages 1~8 of the Story Mission have had their requirements for reaching Tier 2 reduced.<br /> <br /> <br /><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281600/Resized_11.jpg\" /><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281533/CharacterList.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #0070c0; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\">Material costs for Tier-2 advancements have been cut in half<br /> </span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #0070c0; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\">Gold required for Tier-2 Advancement, Mastery, equipment enhancements and upgrading remains the same. <br /> <br />&nbsp;<br /> </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff3300; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">▣</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff3300;\">Other Changes</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ff3300;\"><br /> </span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">1. World Boss bonus effects will no longer be applied to character details windows. <br /> <br />2. &#83;electing a Comic Card from the Cards menu will now display information pertaining to that card.<br /> <img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281533/CardUpdate.png\" /><br /> </span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">3. Conditions for reaching the legendary cinematic supply chest in cinematic mode has been changed. <br />Stages: Incredibly vs Mighty, Wolf Hunting, Executioner&rsquo;s Axe, and Bifrost Battle.<br /> <strong><br />Previous conditions:</strong> 6</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">★</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"> hero and Mythic Uniform<br /> <strong>New Conditions:</strong> 6</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">★</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"> hero and Legendary Uniform<br /> <br />4. ISO-8 ordering in the ISO-8 window has been improved. It will now show ISO-8&rsquo;s in the following order:<br /><br /><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">Rank/Stat affected/Stat number</span><br /> <img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281533/ISO8Update.png\" /><br /> </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">5. New &#98;uttons have been added when upgrading equipment, allowing quick scrolling</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281533/GearUpdate.png\" /></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">6. In the SHIELD lab, the processor will now show what item will be produced if a jackpot&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">occurs.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281533/JackpotUpdate.png\" /></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">7. On the mission ready screen, if there are not enough Boost Points the Boost Points will be red.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/11/281533/InsufficientBoostPointUpdate.png\" /></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">8. A screen has been added showing where the World Boss Bonus applies. <br /> <br />9. The Status Board has been improved. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; -Cinematic Battle has been added<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; -If the content has been completed, it will now show when the content will be &#114;efreshed. <br /> <br />10. Fixed the following issues:<br />- Thor (Ragnarok Uniform), when using &ldquo;Conjure Lightning&rdquo;, the damage would stack on the enemy. <br />- After completing the Scarlet Witch World Boss Mission, the game would close the app after completing the stage twice. <br />- Ability to place 3 of the same heroes on one team in the Mission Preparation screen has been fixed. <br />- Destroyer&rsquo;s &ldquo;Crush&rdquo; skill has been fixed. <br />- When checking another p&#108;ayers user information, URU would not be shown. <br />- When using clear tickets after changing team in Dimension Rifts, an error message would show. <br /> <br />11. Fixed an issue where characters that can revive would be classed as defeated before they revived in Shadowlands King of the Hill mode. <br /> <br />12. The number and type of reward given for Hero&rsquo;s Journey where Lv.5 EXP chips were given has been changed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>"
